AgRRNgIymIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuxYeB46xtK_GxcvgT2nw6GtuHXmtqii_nbBvZrup836w&oe=69985EAB"}, {"file_name": "PoolScreen.png", "id": "243997814869068", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982675_243997818202401_35384399934413085_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VN7kh4_bCv0Q7kNvwFLIgHk&_nc_oc=AdlTuDZh-q9rCIcrzUkQOrWn9Z7ViSnhospVS537dpUa-NbitCf9XejFMq8bHbViy-w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvlgbTpaIBrPquzoNIWq4v-t9QD6ZfyshVKBVN8ZkkFoA&oe=69984688"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GenieGymCoverLandscape.png", "id": "328896759640837", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75203622_328896762974170_9218873658952822499_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K6LokF--Rm4Q7kNvwE36SRr&_nc_oc=AdkGJBG5sjXNHBdOTFS4A0WtHwh6kNyASa8tfRtISTmlyL9YGAgxaLvO7HrnF4j1hF0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfteLAxy9l-8cBbCbUS4uexJi1cmOk_RONc2W1E0o4Em4A&oe=69985302"}, "display_name": "Genie Gym", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Are you looking for something more than a virtual copy of a traditional game? Want to play something playfully unique? Genie Gym is a reimagining of popular sports games for the virtual world. 3D versions of pool, bocce, and cornhole offer a casual experience, while 3D versions of pong, tennis, handball, and spikeball offer something more fast paced. There is a game for everyone!\n\nTrack your wins on the leaderboard and improve your skill to become the best. Customize your Genie to match your style. Three themes are available to choose from: solar, stone, and metal. \n\nFree updates are coming for all players of Genie Gym that will bring a variety of arenas to choose from and play in, additional styles of game tables, matches, rule sets, and multiplayer variety.", "short_description": "A playfully unique game with traditional origins. Enjoy seven game modes that turn the familiar into 